.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH diff 1  "diff " 
.SH NAME
diff \- Analyse a supplied diff instead of the working repository
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdiff\fR [\fB\-\-stdin\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIFILE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Analyse a supplied diff instead of the working repository
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-stdin\fR
Read the diff from stdin
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIFILE\fR]
Read the diff from a file
